<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="EPH" style="id">EPH-NYANJA Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Aefeso</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kalata ya Poolo kwa Aefeso</para>
  <para style="toc2">Aefeso</para>
  <para style="toc3">Aefe</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yayo yalimo muchikalakala ichi Aefeso</para>
  <para style="imt">Aefeso</para>
  <para style="imt">Uchogolelo</para>
  <para style="ip">Kalata kwa Aefeso idalembedwa nyengo imojhi ni kalata kwa Akolosai pachaka cha 60 pambuyo pa kubadwa kwa Kilisito. Olemba wadajhijhiwicha mwene ngati mtumwi Poolo nghope yo 1:1. Osoma ambili avomela kuti Poolo wadalemba kalata ya Aefeso, atangati kalata iyi ilibe moni zake za yokha ngati umo ili kalata kwa Akolosai. Ndande iyi, ikhozekana dala lake idali izungulile mijhi ya wandhu yawo amkhulupilila Kilisito yakumojhi yayo yadalimo mmalo mmenemo. Ndiiponjho Poolo wafotokoza kuti wali mndende ndhawi iyo wamalemba kalata imeneyo nghope ya 3:1 ni nghope ya 4:1 ni nghope ya 6:20. Poolo wadatumiza kalata iyi kupitila Tikiko uyo wadali mmaulendo yoendela gulu la wandhu amkhulupilia Kilisito la Kuefeso, nghope ya 6:21-22.</para>
  <para style="ip">Efeso udali mujhi waukulu makhalo yayakulu ya ulamuli wa chilumi mujhiko la Asiya yaing'ono. Efeso idali yojhiwika kupunda pakuti kudali ni nyumba ya mnungu wao iyo idali mmenemo iyo idasanghidwa ndande ya mmnungu wamkazi wa chigiliki uyo wamatanidwa Alitemi, Vichito nghope ya 19:23-31. Gulu la wandhu a mkhulupilila Kilisito la Kuefeso lidali nichiyambo cha bwino nambho pambuyo lidajhiyawala. Uvunukulo 2:1-7.</para>
  <para style="ip">Malo yoyamba ya kalata iyi Poolo wafotokoza umo Mnungu wadaayangha wandhu ni kwaombola kuchoka mmachimo yao kupitila Yesu Kilisito. Walilinganicha gulu la wandhu amkhulupilila Kilisito ni thupi, ni Kilisito ngati mutu wake. Ndiponjho walilinganichagulu la wandhu amkhulupilila Kilisito ni jhengo, ni Kilisito ngati mwala wa msingi uwo ugwililila jhengo limenelo. Malo yakawili ya kalata iyi, Poolo wachocha muelekelo kulangiza umo ifunikila kukhala mundhu yapo walunjana ni Kilisito.</para>
  <para style="iot">Yayo yalimo mukalata iyi</para>
  <para style="io">Poolo wajhijhiwicha nikwalonjela Aefeso munghope yo 1:1-7.</para>
  <para style="io">Ndiipo wafotokoza mgwilizano wa gulu la wandhu amkhulupilila Kilisito ni Kilisito mwene, nghope yo 1:3 mbaka nghope ya 3:21.</para>
  <para style="io">Ndiipo Poolo walemba kulangiza umo wandhu amkhulupilila Kilisito akufunikila kukhala, nghope ya 4:1 mbaka nghope ya 6:20.</para>
  <para style="io">Mathelo yake Poolo wachocha mawu yothela 6:21-24.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="EPH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 1:1" />Ine Poolo, mtumwi wa Kilisito Yesu, ngati umo wakondela Mnungu, nalembela wandhu yao asanghidwa ni Mnungu, yawo ali Kuefeso yao amkhulupilila Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="EPH 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 1:2" />Tikupembhelani ubwino ni mtendele, kwa Mbuye wathu Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="EPH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mwawi uwo Mnungu watipacha kupitila Kilisito</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 1:3" />Watamandidwe Mnungu, Atate wa Ambuye wathu Yesu Kilisito! Ndande ya kulunjana ni Kilisito watipacha mwawi wambili wa mzimu kuchoka kumwamba. <verse eid="EPH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 1:4" />Jhiko likali losaumbwidwe, Mnungu wadatisangha tikhale wao pakulunjana ni Kilisito, dala tikhale wandhu yawo tasanghidwa ni Mnungu, yawo tilibe chimo pachogolo pake. Ndande ya chikondi chake, <verse eid="EPH 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 1:5" />jhiko likali losaumbidwe Mnungu kutisangha, tikhale wana wake kupitila Yesu Kilisito nde umo wadakondela ni chifuno chake mwene.<verse eid="EPH 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 1:6" />Chimwecho, timtamande Mnungu kwa ulemelelo wa ubwino wake uwo watipacha ife kwakupitila mwana wake wa payokha. <verse eid="EPH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 1:7" />Kwakupitila mwazi wake Kilisito ife taomboledwa, mate yake talekeleledwa machimo yathu. Kuchokana ni kuchuluka kwa ubwino wake, <verse eid="EPH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 1:8" />uwo adatipacha kwambili, kwa hekima ni kujhiwa konjhe. <verse eid="EPH 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 1:9" />Mnungu wadatijhiwicha vindhu vake ivo vidabisika va chikondi chake, umo wamafunila, kupitila Yesu Kilisito. <verse eid="EPH 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 1:10" />Ndhawi yake yapo idafika wadachita icho wachifuna ni kukusa voumbidwa vonjhe, kila kandhu kumwamba ni pajhiko, panjhi pa Kilisito.<verse eid="EPH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 1:11" />Kwa kulunjana ni Kilisito, ife tasanghidwa kukhala wake jhiko likali losaumbidwe kwa dala lake, iye wachita vindhu vonjhe ngati umo waafunila. <verse eid="EPH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 1:12" />Mnungu wadachita chimwecho, dala ife Ayahudi tachogolela kumkhulupilila Kilisito tiutamande ukulu wake!<verse eid="EPH 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 1:13" />Chimchijha namwenjho, wandhu yawo asatia Ayahudi mudauvela Uthenga wa uzene, uthenga uwo wakupelekelani uomboli. Mudamkhulupilila Kilisito, ni kukuikani chizindikilo kulangiza kuti wake kwa kukupachani Mzimu yujha Mnungu wadatikambila kuti siwatupache. <verse eid="EPH 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 1:14" />Mzimu umenewo ndeuwo wachita tiyapate yonjhe yayo wadatikambila Mnungu kwa wandhu wake, chindhu ichi chitilangiza kuti Mnungu siwaombole wandhu wake onjhe. Ife tiutamande ulemelelo wake.<verse eid="EPH 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Poolo wapembhela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 1:15" />Kuchokela yapo nidavela umo mwakhulupilila Ambuye Yesu, ni chikondi chanu kwa wandhu a Mnungu, <verse eid="EPH 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 1:16" />sinidasiye kumuyamika Mnungu ndande yanu. Yapo nimpembha Mnungu nikukumbukilani. <verse eid="EPH 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 1:17" />Niyendekela kumpembha Mnungu wa Ambuye wathu Yesu Kilisito, Atate aulemelelo, akupachenu Mzimu wao uwo siukuchiteni mkhale woyela ni kukuvunukulilani kumjhiwa Mnungu. <verse eid="EPH 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 1:18" />Nimpembha Mnungu wamasule mitima yanu ione dangalila, mkhoze kujhiwa chikhulupililo chijha akutanilani ni ulemelelo waukulu ni mbhaso iyo waikila wandhu wake. <verse eid="EPH 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 1:19" />Mmpembha Mnungu mujhiwe kukhoza kwake ni umo wali wakulu kwa ife timkhulupilila. Wakhoza kuchita njhito mkati mwathu kulingana ni ijha mbhavu yake yaikulu kupunda, <verse eid="EPH 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 1:20" />ijha mbhavu idamuhyucha Kilisito, nikumkalicha bendeka la kwene la ulemu kumwamba. <verse eid="EPH 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 1:21" />Kumeneko kumwamba Kilisito walamulila ufumu wonjhe, ulamuli, mbhavu ni ukulu, ni walamulila kila icho chichulidwa, pajhiko lino ni jhiko ilo likujha. <verse eid="EPH 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 1:22" />Mnungu waika vindhu vonjhe pa ulamulilo wake, adamuika kukhala wamkululu wa vindhu vonjhe kwa gulu la wandhu amkhulupilila. <verse eid="EPH 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 1:23" />Gulu la wandhu amkhulupilila Kilisito nithupi la Kilisito, nianyiiwo akwanilichidwa niiye, uyo wakwanila kwa vindhu vonjhe kila pamalo.<verse eid="EPH 1:23" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="EPH 2" />
  <para style="s">Kuchoka kunyifa kulowa ku umoyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 2:1" />Anyiimwe mudafa ndande ya volakwa ni machimo yanu. <verse eid="EPH 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 2:2" />Nyengo zijha mmakhala kwa kuchata mtundu wa jhiko lino, ni kumvela mfumu wa chiwanda cha mbhavu ya mlengalenga, chiwanda chalaamulila wandhu yawo chipano samvela Mnungu. <verse eid="EPH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 2:3" />Ife nafe taonjhe timakhala ngati anyiiwo, timachata makhumbilo yathu ya jhiko ni kuchita ivo vikwadilicha matupi ni njelu zathu. Nafe mmayambo tidali ngati anyiiwo, timafunika tilangidwe ni Amnungu.<verse eid="EPH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 2:4" />Nambho Mnungu ni alisungu kupunda. Adatikonda kwa chikondi chachikulu, <verse eid="EPH 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 2:5" />ata ngati tidamwalila ndande ya machimo, adatichita amoyo pamojhi ni Kilisito. Kwa ubwino wa Mnungu anyiimwe mwaomboledwa. <verse eid="EPH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 2:6" />Kwakulunjana ni Kilisito Yesu, Mnungu wadatihyucha pamojhi ni iye, tikalamulile pamojhi nayo kumwamba, <verse eid="EPH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 2:7" />dala alangize kuchuluka kwa ubwino wao nyengo izo zikujha kwa kulunjana kwa kwathu ni Kilisito Yesu. <verse eid="EPH 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 2:8" />Mwaomboledwa kwa ubwino wa Mnungu kwa knjila ya kukhulupila, asati kwa vichito vanu vabwino. Iyi ni mbhaso kuchoka kwa Mnungu. <verse eid="EPH 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 2:9" />Asati kwa vichito vanu mwachinawene, chimwecho mundhu waliyonjhe siwadajhielekela. <verse eid="EPH 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 2:10" />Ife taumbidwa ni Mnungu kwa kulunjana ni Kilisito Yesu, dala tichite vichito vabwino ivo adatikonjekela tivichite kuyambila mmayambo.<verse eid="EPH 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ayahudi ni osati Ayahudi nichindhu chimojhi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 2:11" />Kumbukilani kale anyiimwe asati Ayahudi kwa kubadwa Ayahudi adakutanani, “Wosachitidwe mdulidwe,” Nambho anyiiwo ajhitana, “Wochitidwa mdulidwe” ndande chijha achitidwa mmatupi yawo. <verse eid="EPH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 2:12" />Kumbukilani kuti nyengo imeneyo mudalibe Kilisito, simudali wandhu aku jhiko la Izilaeli, mdali alendo yawo mudalibe malo muvipangano ivo wadakamba Mnungu. Mudali ngati wandhu osakhulupilile ni wandhu yawo siamjhiwa Mnungu pano pajhiko la panjhi. <verse eid="EPH 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 2:13" />Nambho chipano, kwa kulunjana ni Kilisito, anyiimwe yawo mdali patali mmayambo mwali pafupi kwa njila ya mwazi wa Kilisito. <verse eid="EPH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 2:14" />Kilisito nde uyo watipacha mtendele wandhu asati Ayahudi ni Ayahudi kukhala amojhi. Kwakulichocha thupi lake likhale njhembe ya nyifa, wadaucho udani uwo udatichichekeleza ngati phupha. <verse eid="EPH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 2:15" />Wadang'anamula thauko la Musa, malamulo ni maagizo ya Ayahudi, dala wachite awili achameneo akhale chindhu chimojhi ni kupeleka mtendele. <verse eid="EPH 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 2:16" />Kilisito wadauwananga udani wao kwa kupitila nyifa yake mtanda, chimwecho wadaavanichana onjhe awili ni Mnungu. <verse eid="EPH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 2:17" />Chimwecho Kilisito wadajha kulalikila mtendele ngati Uthenga Wabwino, kwa anyiimwe wandhu asati Ayahudi yao samamjhiwe Mnungu ni kwa Ayahudi yao amamjhiwa Mnungu. <verse eid="EPH 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 2:18" />Kwa kupitila iye ife taonjhe Ayahudi ni wandhu asati Ayahudi tikhoza kwa wandikila Atate kwa mzimu wa Mnungu.<verse eid="EPH 2:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 2:19" />Chimwecho anyiimwe asatinjho alendo, ni asati wandhu opita njila, nambho ni wenyejhi pamojhi ni wandhu a Mnungu, ni wandhu akhamu la Amnungu. <verse eid="EPH 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 2:20" />Mwamangidwa pa mwamba pa msingi uwo waikidwa ni atumwi ni alosi, Kilisito mwene walingana ni nde mwala waukulu uwo ugwililila nyumba. <verse eid="EPH 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 2:21" />Iye ndeuyo walunjanicha nyumba yonjhe ni kuikweza ikhale yaikulu ngati nyumba ya Mnungu mwene ndande ya Ambuye. <verse eid="EPH 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 2:22" />Kwa kulunjana niiye anyiimwe namwe mwamangidwa pamojhi ni wina onjhe, mukhale nyumba ya Mnungu kupitila mzimu wake.<verse eid="EPH 2:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="EPH 3" />
  <para style="s">Njhito ya Poolo kwa wandhu asati Ayahudi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 3:1" />Kuchokana ni yameneyo, ine Poolo uyo namangidwa ndande ya kumtumikila Kilisito Yesu ndande ya anyiimwe, wandhu asati Ayahudi nimpembha Mnungu. <verse eid="EPH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 3:2" />Nijhiwa mwathovela kuti Mnungu kwa ubwino wake, wadanipacha njhito iyi yakukulalikilani anyiimwe Uthenga Wabwino. <verse eid="EPH 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 3:3" />Ine nidajhiwichidwa chindhu ichi chobisika kupitila chisisi, nane nachilemba chindhu ichi kwa mau yochepa, <verse eid="EPH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 3:4" />namwe mkayasoma mau yanga simujhiwe umo nichijhiwila chisisi chimemenecho cha nghani ya Kilisito. <verse eid="EPH 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 3:5" />Chisisi chimenecho, siwadachijhiwichepo kwa wandhu akale, nambho chipano wajhiwicha chisisi chimenecho atumwi ni alosi yawo asanghidwa kwa kupitila Mzimu wa Mnungu. <verse eid="EPH 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 3:6" />Chisisi chimenecho ni kuti, kwa kupitila Uthenga Wabwino wandhu asati Ayahudi apata yajha Mnungu wadakamba kuti siwapache Ayahudi. Anyiiwo ni viwalo va thupi limojhi ni ogwilizana achijha wadakamba Mnungu kuti siwapache kupitila Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="EPH 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 3:7" />Ine nachitidwa kukhala Mtumiki wa kulalikila Uthenga Wabwino kwa ubwino wa Mnungu uwo wanipacha kuchokana ni kukhoza kwake kwa kukulu. <verse eid="EPH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 3:8" />Ine nili wamng'ono kulekana ni wandhu onjhe wa Mnungu, nambho wanipacha ine ubwino wake kuti nalalikile wandhu asati Ayahudi ubwino wa Kilisito uwo siufotokozeka, <verse eid="EPH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 3:9" />kuika padanga kwa wandhu onjhe aone mpango uwo Mnungu uwo wabisika umo ukwanilichidwa. Mnungu uyo waumba vindhu vonjhe wadachibisa chisisi chimenecho kuyambila kale, <verse eid="EPH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 3:10" />dala kwa kupitila gulu la wandhu amkhulupilila Kilisito, afumu ni alamuli akumwamba aijhiwe hekima ya Mnungu iyo ili ya mtundu wambili. <verse eid="EPH 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 3:11" />Mnungu wadachita chimwechi kuchokana ni dala lake la muyaya ilo wadachita kupitila Yesu Kilisito Ambuye wathu. <verse eid="EPH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 3:12" />Chipano kwa kulunjana ni Kilisito ni kumkhulupilila, tipilila kumuwandikila Mnungu kwa kumkhulupilila. <verse eid="EPH 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 3:13" />Chimwecho simudafa mtima ndande ya mavuto yayo nipata ine ndande yanu, yameneyo yakuchitani mlemekezeke.<verse eid="EPH 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Poolo wapembhela Aefeso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 3:14" />Chipano nimphembha Mnungu Tate kwa kumgwadila, <verse eid="EPH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 3:15" />uyowali chiyambo cha voumbidwa vonjhe va kumwamba ni pajhiko. <verse eid="EPH 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 3:16" />Nimpembha Mnungu, wakupacheni ngati umo kuli kuchuluka kwa ulemelelo wake, wakupacheni mbhavu za mzimu wake, ni mbhavu mkati mwanu yoima nganganga, <verse eid="EPH 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 3:17" />dala Kilisito wakhale mkati mwanu kwa njila ya kumkhulupilila. Nimpembha Mnungu yonjhe yayo muyachita yachoke muchikondi cha zene, <verse eid="EPH 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 3:18" />dala anyiimwe pamojhi ni wandhu onjhe a Mnungu, mjhiwe umo Kilisito watikondela kupunda kwa chikondi icho chilibe mathelo, <verse eid="EPH 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 3:19" />ni mujhiwe chikondi cha Kilisito icho chipitilila umo ajhiwila wandhu wonjhe, mukhale wokwanila kupunda kwa Mnungu.<verse eid="EPH 3:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 3:20" />Iye uyo wakhoza kuchita vindhu vodabwicha kupunda kupitilila vijha tivipembha ni kuvighanizila. Kuchokana ni mbhavu zake izo zichita njhito mkati mwathu. <verse eid="EPH 3:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 3:21" />Watamandidwe, ulemelelo wake ukhale kwa gulu la wandhu wonjhe akhulupilila Kilisito ni kwa Kilisito Yesu ndhawi zonjhe, Muyaya ni muyaya! Ikhale chimwecho.<verse eid="EPH 3:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="EPH 4" />
  <para style="s">Umojhi wa wandhu okhulupilila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 4:1" />Ndiipo ine nili omangidwa ndande ya kwatumikila Ambuye, nikupembhani kupunda mukhale ngati umo Mnungu wakutanilani. <verse eid="EPH 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 4:2" />Mkhale ojhichicha ni apole, mlimbilane mitima mwachinawene kwa mwachinawene kwa chikondi. <verse eid="EPH 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 4:3" />Limbichani umojhi wa Mzimu wa Mnungu, ni mkhale kwa mtendele pakati panu. <verse eid="EPH 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 4:4" />Kuli ni thupi limojhi ni mzimu umojhi, ngati umo kukhulupilila kuli kumojhi uko mwatanidwila ni Mnungu uyo wali mmojhi. <verse eid="EPH 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 4:5" />Kuli ni Ambuye amojhi, kukhulupilila ni kumojhi ni ubatizi niumojhi, <verse eid="EPH 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 4:6" />kuli ni Mnungu mmojhi, Atate waonjhe yao alamulila vonjhe, wachita njhito kwa wonjhe ni wali kwa wonjhe.<verse eid="EPH 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 4:7" />Kila mmojhi wathu walandila mwawi wa Mzimu wa Mnungu kuchokana ni umo Kilisito wampachila. <verse eid="EPH 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 4:8" />Ndendande yalembedwa mumalembo ya Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">“Yapo adakwela kumwamba kupunda,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">adaatenga omangidwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 4:8">wadapacha wandhu mbhaso.”<verse eid="EPH 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 4:9" />Ndiipo yapo ikambidwa, “Wadakwela kumwamba,” mate yake chiyani? Mate yake ni kuti, poyamba wadachika mbaka panjhi pajhiko. <verse eid="EPH 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 4:10" />Chipano mmeneyo uyo wachika nde uyo wadakwela kumwamba kupunda, dala waenele kila pamalo. <verse eid="EPH 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 4:11" />Nde uyo wapacha wandhu mbhaso za Mzimu wa Mnungu, wina kukhala atumwi, wina alosi wina olalikila Uthenga Wabwino, wina abusa ni wina oyaluza. <verse eid="EPH 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 4:12" />Adachita chimwecho ndande ya kwakonjekela wandhu wonjhe a Mnungu, kwa njhito ya kumtumikila Kilisito chimwecho okhulupilila onjhe akhala nganganga ngati umo lili thupi la Kilisito. <verse eid="EPH 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 4:13" />Chimwecho ife tilunjane ni kukhala chindhu chimojhi kwa chikhulupi ni kumjhiwa Mwana wa Mnungu, tikhale wandhu okwanila ni tikhoze kufikila kukwanila kwa Kilisito mwene wake. <verse eid="EPH 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 4:14" />Chimwecho sitikhalanjho ngati wana akhanda, nitipelekedwa uku ni uku ni mayaluzo ya kila mtundu, ya oyaluza aunami yao alakwicha wina. <verse eid="EPH 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 4:15" />Nambho ngati tikauchota uzene kwa mtima wa chikondi sitikule chizimu ni sitimfikile Kilisito pa vindhu vonjhe, iye nde mlamuli wathu. <verse eid="EPH 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 4:16" />Kwa kuchogozedwa ni Kilisito, thupi lonjhe likalunjidwa ni kugwilizidwa pamojhi, kwa mthandizo wa kila chiwalo. Chipano, kila chiwalo chichita njhito yake, thupi lonjhe likula lene ni kujhikonja muchikondi.<verse eid="EPH 4:16" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umoyo wachipano ni umowo wakale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 4:17" />Chimwecho, nikuonyani kwa ulamulilo uwo napachidwa ni Ambuye. Msadakhalanjho ngati wandhu yao samjhiwa Mnungu, maganizo yao yali yoipa. <verse eid="EPH 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 4:18" />Njelu zao zili mumdima, alipatali ni umoyo wa Mnungu ndande ya usabobwa wao ni mitima yao yolimba. <verse eid="EPH 4:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 4:19" />Apanduka, alibe njhoni, ali ni ukhalo woyipa, ni apapalikila kupunda vindhu va manyazi va kila mtundu. <verse eid="EPH 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 4:20" />Nambho anyiimwe simudajhiyaluze chimwecho kwa nghani ya Kilisito. <verse eid="EPH 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 4:21" />Anyiimwe mwazivela bwino nghani zake, muli ochatila wake mdayaluzidwa mayaluzo ya uzene ya nghani za Yesu. <verse eid="EPH 4:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 4:22" />Mudayaluzidwa muvisiye vichito vanu voipa ivo madavichita kale, ngati mujha mundhu wavulila njalu ni kuisiya, vichito ivo vimawanangidwa ni khumbilo launami. <verse eid="EPH 4:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 4:23" />Mmizimu mwanu ni mmaganizo yanu mving'anamule vikhale va chipano. <verse eid="EPH 4:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 4:24" />Mkhale ni umoyo wa chipano, ngati umo mmungu wadakuumbani, mlingane niiye uku muli ovomelezeka kupunda ni kukhala umo ifunukila.<verse eid="EPH 4:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 4:25" />Chimwecho, usiyeni unami. Kila mmojhi wafunika wamkambile mnjake uzene, ndande kila mmojhi ni chiwalo cha Kilisito. <verse eid="EPH 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 4:26" />Mkakwiya, mbhwai yanu siidakuchitichani mchite machimo, ni simdalongeza ni mbhwai siku la mbhumbhu mbaka yapo jhuwa yapo libila, <verse eid="EPH 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 4:27" />dala simudampacha Satana malo. <verse eid="EPH 4:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 4:28" />Uyo wakuba, siwadabanjho, nambho wayambe kuchita njhito yabwino kwa manja yake, dala wakhale ni chindhu cha kumthangatila osauka. <verse eid="EPH 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 4:29" />Simudakamba mawu yoipa, nambho mawu yanu yajhikhala ya kwathangatila wina kuchokana ni icho afuna, dala yathangatile yawo akuvelani. <verse eid="EPH 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 4:30" />Simudamdandaulicha Mzimu wa Mnungu, pakuti Mzimu umeneo ni chizindikilo cha Mnungu kwanu kuti anyiimwe ni wandhu wake, ni uchimikizo ndande ya siku la uomboli. <verse eid="EPH 4:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 4:31" />Chimwecho siyani kukhala ni dungulila, ipilo, mbhwai, pokoso ni matukwano ni msiye kila mtundu wa voipa. <verse eid="EPH 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 4:32" />Mkhale ni mtima wa bwino ni kulengelana lisungu, kila mmojhi wamlekelele mnjake ngati Mnungu umo wakulekelelani anyiimwe kwa kupitila ya Kilisito.<verse eid="EPH 4:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="EPH 5" />
  <para style="s">Tikhale kwa kumkwadilicha Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 5:1" />Anyiimwe ni wana a Mnungu yawo wakundani kupunda, chimwecho mjhitahidi kukhala ngati iye. <verse eid="EPH 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 5:2" />Mkhale kwa chikondi, ngati umo Kilisito wadatikondela, wadajhichocha ndande ya ife kukhala njhembe iyo inunghila yakumkwadilicha Mnungu.<verse eid="EPH 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 5:3" />Anyiimwe ni wandhu a Mnungu, chimwecho chighololo, ukhalo waliyojhe woipa kapina chipili, sividakhala pakati panu, pakuti anyiimwe ni wandhu a Mnungu. <verse eid="EPH 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 5:4" />Chimwecho, siyadakhalapo mawu ya njhoni, mawu ya mtafu kapina ya vibwana, yonjheyo siyafunika, icho chifunika ni kumuyamika Mnungu. <verse eid="EPH 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 5:5" />Mjhiwe kuti wachigololo waliyonjhe, kapina mkazuzu kapina wokhumbila, mundhu ngati mmeneyo siwapata chilinjhonjhe muufumu wa Kilisito ni Mnungu. Mundhu wakhumbilo walambila chiboliboli.<verse eid="EPH 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 5:6" />Siwadakunyengani mundhu kwa mawu yopande mate, ndande ya vindhu ngati vimenevo, mbhwai ya Mnungu yajhela onjhe yao samvela, <verse eid="EPH 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 5:7" />chimwecho, simudagwilizana ni wandhu yao achita vindhu vimenevo. <verse eid="EPH 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 5:8" />Kale anyiimwe mdali mumdima simmamjhiwe Mnungu, nambho chipano muli mudangalila, mumjhiwa Mnungu kwa kulunjana ni Ambuye Yesu. Mkhale umo wafunila Mnungu, <verse eid="EPH 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 5:9" />pakuti yayo yachokela mdangalila ni ubwino, uzene ni kukhala kwa kuvomelezeka ni Mnungu. <verse eid="EPH 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 5:10" />Namwe yafunefuneni yayo yakhadwilicha Ambuye. <verse eid="EPH 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 5:11" />Simudagwilizana kuchita vichito ivo sivifunika va mumdima, nambho yaikeni pandhandala dala wandhu ayajhiwe. <verse eid="EPH 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 5:12" />Vindhu ivo avichita kwa chisisi vilengecha njhoni ata kuvichula. <verse eid="EPH 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 5:13" />Nambho chilichonjhe icho chavumbula ni dangalila, sichioneke, <verse eid="EPH 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 5:14" />ndande chilichonjhe icho chavumbulidwa, chikhala dangalila. Nde ndande yalembedwa Mumalembo ya Mnungu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">“Uka iwe waghona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">uhyuke,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="EPH 5:14">Kilisito siwakuwalichile dangalila lake.”<verse eid="EPH 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 5:15" />Ndiipo mjhijhipenyelela umo mukhalila. Simudakhala ngati asabobwa, nambho mkhale wandhu a hekima. <verse eid="EPH 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 5:16" />Muitumile bwino dhawi iyo mulinayo, ndande masiku yaya ni yoipa. <verse eid="EPH 5:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 5:17" />Chimwecho, simudakhala asabobwa, nambho muyajhiwe yayo ayafuna Ambuye. <verse eid="EPH 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 5:18" />Msiye kulojhela mowa, imeneyo siikutaizeni, nambho mchoghozedwe ni Mzimu wa Mnungu. <verse eid="EPH 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 5:19" />Mjhiimbilana kwa mawu ya zabuli, nyimbo za matamando ni nyimbo zina za Mzimu wa Mnungu, muimbileni ni kumtamanda Mnungu kwa mitima yanu yonjhe. <verse eid="EPH 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 5:20" />Muyamikeni Mnungu Atate masiku yonjhe kwa vindhu vonjhe, kwa kupitila Ambuye wathu Yesu Kilisito.<verse eid="EPH 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Umo afunikila kukhala wamuna ni wamkazi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 5:21" />Kila mmojhi wajhichiche kwa mnjake kwa ulemu uwo muli nawo kwa Kilisito.<verse eid="EPH 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 5:22" />Anyiimwe wachikazi mjhavela achamunanu ngati kwa vela Ambuye Yesu. <verse eid="EPH 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 5:23" />Mate yake wammuna nayo wali ni ulamuli kwa mkazake, ngati umo Kilisito wali ni ulamuli kwa gulu la wandhu amkulupilila Kilisito, ndande Kilisito mwene wake nde waliombola gulu limenelo ni nde thupi lake. <verse eid="EPH 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 5:24" />Ngati umo gulu la wandhu amkhulupilila Kilisito limvelela iye, chimchijha wachikazi ajhavela achamunao kwa vindhu vonjhe.<verse eid="EPH 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="EPH 5:25" />Anyiimwe wachimuna, mjhakonda achakazanu ngati Kilisito umo wadalikondela gulu lake, wadajhichocha njhembe ndande yawo, <verse eid="EPH 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="EPH 5:26" />dala kwa mawu lake, walipatule kwa Mnungu kwa kulichuka mumajhi, <verse eid="EPH 5:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="EPH 5:27" />dala wapate gulu la wandhu amkhulupilila, ilo la sanghidwa ndande ya Mnungu ni labwino, gulu ilo lilibe machimo, kupunduka kapina chilichonjhe cha mtundu umeneo. <verse eid="EPH 5:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="EPH 5:28" />Chimwecho wachimuna afunika kwakonda achakazao ngati matupi yawo. Uyo wamkonda mkazake mmeneyo wajhikonda mwene. <verse eid="EPH 5:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="EPH 5:29" />Palibe mundhu uyo waliipila thupi lake, nambho walidyecha ni kuliveka. Nde umo Kilisito walisungila gulu lake, <verse eid="EPH 5:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="EPH 5:30" />pakuti ife ni viwalo va thupi lake. <verse eid="EPH 5:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="EPH 5:31" />“Chimwecho, wammuna siwaasiye atate wake ni amaye wake, siwalunjane ni mkazake nao awili sakhale thupi limojhi.” <verse eid="EPH 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="EPH 5:32" />Kuli ni uzene uwo wabisika pa mawu yaya, ila ine nakamba nghani ya Kilisito ni gulu ilo la mkhulupilila. <verse eid="EPH 5:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="EPH 5:33" />Nambho kila wammuna ifunika wamkonde mkazake ngati mwene wake ni wamkazi wafunika kumsamala mmunake.<verse eid="EPH 5:33" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="EPH 6" />
  <para style="s">Nghani ya wana ni obala</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="EPH 6:1" />Anyiimwe wana, ndande mwalunjana ni Ambuye Yesu mujhavela obala wanu pakuti ichi ni chindhu cha bwino. <verse eid="EPH 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="EPH 6:2" />“Alemekeze Atate wako ni amaye wako,” ili nde lamulo loyamba ilo adakamba Ambuye, <verse eid="EPH 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="EPH 6:3" />“Upate mwawi ni ukhale vyaka vambili pajhiko.”<verse eid="EPH 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="EPH 6:4" />Namwe anya Atate, simdachitila voipa wana wanu, nambho aleleni akhale ni ulemu ni mayaluzo ya Ambuye.<verse eid="EPH 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Akapolo ni wakulu wao</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="EPH 6:5" />Namwe akapolo, mjhavela achambuye wanu apano pajhiko, kwa kwalemekeza. Chitani chimwecho kwa mtima wabwino ngati kumvela Kilisito. <verse eid="EPH 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="EPH 6:6" />Chitani chimwecho, asati yapo akupenyanipe dala kwa kwadilicha, nambho tumikilani kwa mtima wabwino ngati umo wafunila Mnungu, ndande anyiimwe ni akapolo a Kilisito. <verse eid="EPH 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="EPH 6:7" />Chitani njhito kwa mtima onjhe kwa kukondwela, ngati kwa atumikila Ambuye, asati kwa kwatumikila wandhu. <verse eid="EPH 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="EPH 6:8" />Mjhiwe kuti kila uyo wachita vabwino, wakhale kapolo kapina mfulu, siwalandile mbhaso kuchoka kwa Ambuye.<verse eid="EPH 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="EPH 6:9" />Namwe yawo mutumikilidwa, achitileni chimwecho akapolo wanu, simudaofya. Kumbukilani kuti anyiimwe muli ngati anyiiwo, Muli ni Ambuye yuyujha mmojhi wakumwamba, nayo sampatula mundhu.<verse eid="EPH 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Valani vida va Mnungu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="EPH 6:10" />Mathelo, niikufunani mukhale nganganga pa kulunjana ni Ambuye ni kwa kukhozechedwa kwa mbhavu zake. <verse eid="EPH 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="EPH 6:11" />Valani vida vonjhe va Mnungu, mkhoze kuchekeleza misambha ya Satana. <verse eid="EPH 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="EPH 6:12" />Nghondo yathu asati kubulana ni wandhu, nambho kubulana ni magulu ya viwanda mujhiko la chizimu, tibulana ni alamuli, afumu ni ambhavu za yawo alamulila jhiko lino la chizimu. <verse eid="EPH 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="EPH 6:13" />Chimwecho, valani vida ivo wakupachani Mnungu, mkhoze kulimbana pa siku la mavuto, ni mkabulana mbaka pothela simuendekele kukhala nganganga.<verse eid="EPH 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="EPH 6:14" />Chipano, imani nganganga, muli wojhimanga zene ngati lamba muchiuno mwanu, kuvomelezeka kukhale ngati chivalo cho jhikengelela pamtima, <verse eid="EPH 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="EPH 6:15" />mkhale tayali kulalikila Uthenga Wabwino wa mtendele ngati vilato myendo mwanu. <verse eid="EPH 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="EPH 6:16" />Kupitilila yonjhe, chikhulupi chikhale chitetezo mmanja mwanu, chikhoze kizithima misonga ya moto ya satana. <verse eid="EPH 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="EPH 6:17" />Ulandileni uomboli ngati chisoti cha chichulo, ngati upanga wa Mzimu uwo uli mawu la Mnungu. <verse eid="EPH 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="EPH 6:18" />Pembhelani siku zonjhe kwa mbhavu ya Mzimu, nikupembha mthandizo wa Mnungu. Chezelelani popande kulema nimwapembhela wandhu onjhe a Mnungu. <verse eid="EPH 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="EPH 6:19" />Mjhinipembhela ni ine, dala yapo nikamba, Mnungu wanipache chokamba, nikhoze kuuzila chisisi cha Uthenga Wabwino kwa kupilila, <verse eid="EPH 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="EPH 6:20" />pakuti Mnungu wanituma kuuzila Uthenga Wabwino, ingakhale namangidwa. Chimwecho nipembheleni, dala nikhoze kuima nganganga pakulalikila ngati umo ifunikila.<verse eid="EPH 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="s">Moni zothela</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="EPH 6:21" />Chimwecho, nimtuma Tukiko mbale wathu uyo timkonda kupunda, ni mtumiki okhulupilika kwa kulunjana ni Ambuye, siwakujhiwicheni nghani zanga zonjhe dala mujhiwe icho nichita. <verse eid="EPH 6:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="EPH 6:22" />Nimtuma kwanu wakupacheni nghani zathu, dala wakuthileni mtima.<verse eid="EPH 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="EPH 6:23" />Chimwechpo achabale wanga nimpembha Mnungu Tate ni Atate wathu Yesu Kilisito, akupacheni mtendele, chikondi ni kukhulupilila. <verse eid="EPH 6:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="EPH 6:24" />Nimpembha Mnungu, wakupacheni Ubwino mwaonjhe yawo mukonda Ambuye wathu Yesu Kilisito, kwa chikondi icho chilibe mathelo.<verse eid="EPH 6:24" /></para>
  <chapter eid="EPH 6" />
</usx>